## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a robust streaming PCA pipeline under strict latency with sparse, skewed data, drift handling, and interpretable governance alerts.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming PCA (Incremental/River)
- Streaming imputation and online scaling
- Explained variance and component selection
- Loadings interpretation for real-time alerts
- Drift detection and alert throttling

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode for streaming PCA update
function updatePCA(x) {
  impute(x); scale(x); projector.partial_fit(x);
  const comps = projector.components_.slice(0, 15);
  const loadings = get_loadings(comps);
  update_alerts(loadings);
}
```

